# Out of the box first

An example, scenario or named person is context for understanding. It is not a requirement to build.

1. State what OpenCPO already ships that bears on the question, with the feature ID when the canvas has one.
2. Say how that shipped function can be used for Pretium.
3. Ask which of those shipped options to use.
4. Only after the shipped options are exhausted, and only when Admin asks for new work, describe a gap. Do not add it to the implementation plan as a desired requirement unless Admin says it is one.
